desc:AmiSynth Synth (polyphonic subtractive, microtonal)
//tags: instrument synthesizer
//author: AmiSynth
// Port of src/dsp/synth.js. Parameter names = slider variable names = ids in
// src/dsp/params.js (the block between the generated markers is rewritten by
// `npm run gen:jsfx`; do not edit it by hand).
// Tuning: the EDO sliders, or a shared Scala scale in REAPER/Data/AmiSynth/tuning.txt (tuning_source).
// Effects after the voice sum: chorus -> delay (synced to the REAPER tempo) -> reverb, all Off by default.

options:gmem=AmiSynth

// <generated sliders>
slider1:tuning_divisions=12<1,72,1>Tuning Divisions Per Period [steps]
slider2:tuning_period_cents=1200<100,2400,0.001>Tuning Period [cents]
slider3:tuning_ref_note=69<0,127,1>Tuning Reference Note [note]
slider4:tuning_ref_hz=440<100,1000,0.01>Tuning Reference Frequency [Hz]
